# Rough the chamber down to a pressure, then seal it
# Closes the vent, fill and gate valves, starts the vacuum pump and waits 15 s as
# the controller requires, checks the chamber is still above 0.01 Torr, opens the
# vacuum valve, waits up to 20 minutes for the pressure, then closes the vacuum
# valve and stops the pump. It leaves the turbo pump and the foreline valve as they
# are, so start from begin at ambient: if the turbo pump is running, opening the
# vacuum valve is refused and the run stops there.
block pumpdown to <pressure:number 0.01..760 Torr>
load rLACO

hvc vent close
hvc fill close
hvc gate close
hvc pump on
hold 15 s
until chamberP >= 0.01 within 30 s
hvc rough open
until chamberP < {pressure} within 20 min
hvc stop
